WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.830
Ice, and seasons.

00:02.530 --> 00:09.458
Mars is tilted about as much as the Earth, so it has seasons, each nearly twice as long as ours.

00:09.908 --> 00:17.368
Every winter part of its thin air freezes onto the pole as dry-ice frost, and every spring it blows away again.

00:17.818 --> 00:20.835
Under the frost is a cap of water ice.
